NUMBER 3 OF 2013

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF TERNATE,

Considering : a. that violence against women and children is a form of crime against humanity which constitutes a violation of human rights;

b. that the number of cases and victims of violence against women and children in Ternate City is still quite high, while services and protection have not been carried out optimally;

c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

